#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:462
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_UncleHesTooPeppy"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: It's because of POKéMON that\n"
"this boy's got more pep, I suppose…\l"
"But he's become a bit too peppy…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:467
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyWantToChallengeGym"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Aww, UNCLE, please?\p"
"I want to challenge this GYM and see\n"
"how much better I've become.\p"
"Please? May I, please?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:473
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_UncleYourePushingIt"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: Now hold on, WALLY.\p"
"Since you started living with POKéMON,\n"
"you have grown quite a lot stronger.\p"
"But don't you think you're pushing it\n"
"to suddenly challenge a GYM?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:480
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyWeCanBeatAnyone"
msgid ""
"WALLY: I'm not pushing it.\p"
"If I combine forces with RALTS,\n"
"we can beat anyone!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:485
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyWillYouBattleMe"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh! Hi, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I've gotten a lot stronger since\n"
"we met.\p"
"{PLAYER}, I want you and my UNCLE to\n"
"understand that.\p"
"{PLAYER}, please, will you have\n"
"a battle with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:494
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyMyUncleWontKnowImStrong"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh… If you won't battle me,\n"
"{PLAYER}, my UNCLE won't know that I've\l"
"become really strong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:499
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_UncleCanYouBattleWally"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: {PLAYER}{KUN}, was it?\n"
"On WALLY's behalf, can I ask you to\l"
"battle with him just this once?\p"
"I don't think he's going to listen to\n"
"any reason the way he is now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:506
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyPleaseBattleMe"
msgid ""
"WALLY: {PLAYER}, please!\n"
"Battle with me, please.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:510
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyHereICome"
msgid ""
"WALLY: {PLAYER}, thank you.\p"
"Okay… Here I come!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:514
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyDefeat"
msgid ""
"WALLY: … … … … … … …\p"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"I lost…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:519
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyIllGoBackToVerdanturf"
msgid ""
"WALLY: UNCLE…\n"
"I'll go back to VERDANTURF…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:523
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_ThankYouNotEnoughToBattle"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, thank you.\n"
"Being a TRAINER is tough, isn't it?\p"
"It's not enough just to have POKéMON\n"
"and make them battle. That isn't what\l"
"being a real TRAINER is about.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:530
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_UncleNoNeedToBeDown"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: WALLY, there's no need to be so\n"
"down on yourself.\p"
"Why, what's keeping you from becoming\n"
"stronger and stronger?\p"
"Come on, let's go home.\n"
"Everyone's waiting for you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:538
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_UncleVisitUsSometime"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: {PLAYER}{KUN}, it just dawned on me\n"
"that you must be the TRAINER who kept\l"
"an eye out for WALLY when he caught\l"
"his POKéMON.\p"
"Why don't you visit us in VERDANTURF\n"
"sometime?\l"
"I'm sure WALLY would enjoy it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:548
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WallyPokenavCall"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"WALLY: Oh, hello, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I just wanted to tell you that\n"
"my uncle bought me a POKéNAV!\p"
"Now I can get in touch with you\n"
"anytime, {PLAYER}!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:559
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_RegisteredWally"
msgid ""
"Registered WALLY\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:563
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_ScottYouDidntHoldBack"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hehe…\n"
"I was watching that match!\p"
"You're friends with that boy WALLY,\n"
"aren't you?\p"
"But you didn't hold anything back\n"
"and beat him impressively.\p"
"Yeah! That's what a real POKéMON\n"
"battle is all about!\p"
"I idolize TRAINERS like that!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"I'll be cheering for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:576
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WattsonNeedFavorTakeKey"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You look like you have a lot of zip!\l"
"That's a good thing, wahahahaha!\p"
"Fine! I've decided!\n"
"I need a favor, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"MAUVILLE CITY has an underground\n"
"sector called NEW MAUVILLE.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'd like you to go there and\n"
"switch off the GENERATOR.\p"
"The GENERATOR has been running a bit\n"
"haywire. It's getting unsafe.\p"
"Here, this is the KEY to get into\n"
"NEW MAUVILLE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:591
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WattsonWontBeChallenge"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Don't you worry about it.\n"
"It won't be a challenge to you.\p"
"The entrance to NEW MAUVILLE is just\n"
"a short SURF away from ROUTE 110.\p"
"That's it, then, you have my trust!\n"
"Wahahahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:599
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WattsonThanksTakeTM"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\p"
"I knew it, {PLAYER}{KUN}! I knew I'd made\n"
"the right choice asking you!\p"
"This is my thanks--a TM containing\n"
"THUNDERBOLT!\p"
"Go on, you've earned it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:607
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_WattsonYoungTakeCharge"
msgid ""
"WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\p"
"It pleases me to no end to see\n"
"the young step up and take charge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:612
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_NurseHurtMonBackToHealth"
msgid ""
"You know, it's cool to have POKéMON\n"
"battles and stuff…\p"
"But if your POKéMON gets hurt,\n"
"you have to nurse it back to health.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:618
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_AllSortsOfPeopleComeThrough"
msgid ""
"The roads of this town stretch north\n"
"and south, and east and west.\p"
"Because of that, we get all sorts of\n"
"people coming through.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:624
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_RydelVeryGenerous"
msgid ""
"Have you been to RYDEL'S CYCLES yet?\p"
"RYDEL, the owner, is a very generous\n"
"man.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:629
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_PokemonCanJumpYouOnBike"
msgid ""
"Even if you're riding a BIKE,\n"
"wild POKéMON could jump you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:633
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"MAUVILLE CITY\n"
"“The bright and shiny city of fun!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:637
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"MAUVILLE CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADER: WATTSON\l"
"“The cheerfully electrifying man!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:642
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_BikeShopSign"
msgid ""
"“Ride in gravel and shake up your\n"
"soul!”\l"
"RYDEL'S CYCLES$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:647
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_GameCornerSign"
msgid ""
"“The play spot for all!”\n"
"MAUVILLE GAME CORNER$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:651
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_ExplainTV"
msgid ""
"Hi, do you check out TV at all?\p"
"They've added a bunch of cool new\n"
"shows recently.\p"
"TV is so cool. I've seen my friends on\n"
"TV just out of the blue.\p"
"And, sometimes, they even put you on TV\n"
"without telling you.\p"
"I wish I would be on TV sometime.\p"
"That's why I think you should check\n"
"out TVs whenever you can.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity/scripts.inc:663
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Text_BeenCheckingOutTV"
msgid "Hi, have you been checking out TVs?$"
msgstr ""
